  "language_raw": "Spanish",
  "source": "message/dat/Spanish/script/class_c_05.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Spanish/script/class_c_05.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_01",
      "hash64": "B67123804862792C",
      "text": "¡Buenas, cabecillas pensantes!\\nUn día más viejos, un día más sabios.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_02",
      "hash64": "B671268048627E45",
      "text": "Hoy seguiremos desentrañando los maravillosos\\nmisterios que esconde la historia de esta región.\\c\\nO eso suelo decir, pero creo que os vendrá bien\\ndescansar un poco el coco después del examen.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 192,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_03",
      "hash64": "B671258048627C92",
      "text": "Así que hoy voy a darle un enfoque algo distinto\\na la clase para que os resulte más amena, ¿vale?[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_04",
      "hash64": "B671208048627413",
      "text": "Voy a contaros una fábula tradicional de Paldea.\\nUna historia que sucedió hace muuucho tiempo...[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_05",
      "hash64": "B6711F8048627260",
      "text": "Érase una vez un rey amante de los tesoros,\\nal que le encantaba ver aumentar su fortuna.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_06",
      "hash64": "B671228048627779",
      "text": "Cierto día, llegó al reino un mercader del Este,\\natraído por los rumores acerca del monarca y su\\r\\ndevoción por tesoros exóticos de tierras lejanas.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 149,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_07",
      "hash64": "B6712180486275C6",
      "text": "Se presentó ante su majestad y le mostró cuatro\\ntesoros de lo más peculiares.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_08",
      "hash64": "B6712C8048628877",
      "text": "Un caldero, una espada, un juego de tablillas\\ny unos abalorios.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_09",
      "hash64": "B6712B80486286C4",
      "text": "El rey pegó un respingo y se levantó del trono,\\neufórico, pues jamás había visto nada parecido.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_10",
      "hash64": "B66D9E80485F6156",
      "text": "Tanto deseaba hacer suyas semejantes rarezas,\\nque colmó al mercader de monedas de oro.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_11",
      "hash64": "B66D9F80485F6309",
      "text": "Uy, ¿otra vez mirando a la profe a los ojos?\\nLo siento, [VAR 0x0100(0000)], pero te ha tocado.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_12",
      "hash64": "B66D9C80485F5DF0",
      "text": "Uno de los tesoros era un juego de tablillas,\\n¿pero podrías decirnos para qué se usaban?[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_c_05_select_01",
      "hash64": "E88A268926C1CF24",
      "text": "Para escribir en ellas",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_c_05_select_02",
      "hash64": "E88A298926C1D43D",
      "text": "Para conectarse a internet",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_c_05_select_03",
      "hash64": "E88A288926C1D28A",
      "text": "Para preparar la merienda",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_answer_01",
      "hash64": "4CAB7604AC3B14BD",
      "text": "¡Correctísimo! Veo que te gusta ir llenando esa\\ncabecita de conocimientos en el día a día...[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_answer_02",
      "hash64": "4CAB7304AC3B0FA4",
      "text": "¡He dicho tablillas, no tabletas! ¿Es una broma?\\nEn aquella época no existía la tecnología actual.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_answer_03",
      "hash64": "4CAB7404AC3B1157",
      "text": "¡Ni son tabletas, ni están hechas de chocolate!\\c\\nHacerte un bocadillo con ellas te daría un dolor\\nde estómago terrible...[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_13",
      "hash64": "B66D9D80485F5FA3",
      "text": "Estas tablillas de madera se usaban antiguamente\\nen territorios orientales para escribir textos.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_14",
      "hash64": "B66DA280485F6822",
      "text": "Como ya imaginaréis, su demanda se redujo casi\\na cero cuando se popularizó otro material mucho\\r\\nmás versátil: el papel.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_15",
      "hash64": "B66DA380485F69D5",
      "text": "Tal vez la idea de escribir en madera y no en\\npapel le resultara fascinante al rey al ver las\\r\\ntablillas...\\c\\nO tal vez los textos escritos en ellas contuviesen\\nenseñanzas que consideraba formidables...[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 109,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 205,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_16",
      "hash64": "B66DA080485F64BC",
      "text": "El caso es que, esa misma noche, tras poner a\\nbuen recaudo los tesoros recién adquiridos...[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_17",
      "hash64": "B66DA180485F666F",
      "text": "Una horrible catástrofe azotó el castillo del rey,\\ny dicen que, al despuntar el alba, había quedado\\r\\nreducido a escombros.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 124,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_18",
      "hash64": "B66DA680485F6EEE",
      "text": "Una vez más, el timbre no me deja terminar.\\n¡Tan inoportuno como siempre![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_c_05_history_19",
      "hash64": "B66DA780485F70A1",
      "text": "Si no queréis iros al sobre sin saber el final de la\\nfábula, venid a hablar conmigo después de clase.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
